<item><title>Sarjo Mballow Barrow links Bafuloto development to third-term vote</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/sarjo-mballow-barrow-links-bafuloto-development-to-third-f8f4e6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/sarjo-mballow-barrow-links-bafuloto-development-to-third-f8f4e6/</guid><category>Gambia</category><description>The Second Lady told residents their development requests would be met if Adama Barrow wins the December 5 presidential election.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:50:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" length="31578" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
